# Javier Mota Diaz - Frontend Architect

Seville, Spain | javimota83@gmail.com | +34 623 136 549 | [linkedin.com/in/javier-mota/](https://www.linkedin.com/in/javier-mota/)

## Professional Summary

Advanced Senior Frontend Engineer and Software Architect with over 12 years of experience building high-traffic web platforms, scalable architectures, and Micro-Frontends (MFEs) systems. Highly specialized in the JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystem, React, and Node.js for Fullstack development. I have a proven track record of leading complex technological transitions from legacy monolithic systems to distributed, resilient, and efficient ecosystems leveraging React, Vite, Webpack, Module Federation, and ES Modules Import Maps, consistently demonstrating an ability to reinvent myself and rapidly adopt modern paradigms.

My approach is heavily focused on business impact: I have drastically reduced "Customer Lead Time" (by up to 34%), increased deployment frequency (by over 250%), and minimized failure/rollback rates by establishing robust testing practices, continuous integration, and strict cross-domain contracts (Frontend Testing Pyramid, Contract Testing for Backend-for-Frontend, and Product Libraries).

Beyond my core expertise in Frontend Architecture and platform evolution towards modern patterns (Clean Architecture, Data Mesh geared towards Frontend Clickstream), I am actively expanding my capabilities into AI Engineering using tools such as Vertex AI, Model Context Protocol (MCP), and the development of intelligent agents.

I am looking to leverage my architectural vision, technical leadership, and product-oriented mindset in highly demanding environments—preferably within the financial sector or other complex industries—that require technological modernization, innovation in user experience, and the progressive adoption of AI-based solutions.

